A78. That's the way, my boy. ~ ROUTE
A79. This's always been a mother to the poor, innocent lambs. ~ EWE
A80. Soft spots to fall into. ~ MATTRESSES

D1. The kind of bunk parents use on the very young. ~ CRADLE
D2. Here's what Leon Trotsky really is. ~ RUSSIAN
D3. If you see this you have seen the best half of Oporto, Portugal. ~ OPO
D4. This is always followed by money in letters fathers get. ~ SEND
